Z||000000||Ricky||05-03-99||10:28 PM||||I hate to appear so ignorant, but what are the major differences between the 87 GT and regular fiero?
Z||000001||theogre||05-04-99||08:34 AM||||GT/SE/SC Fiero are identical to base models with a couple excetpions.<p>Suspension is stiffer in GT/SE/SC cars.<p>Exterior trim is diferant on GT/SE/SC cars. Not all GT's are "fastback." Nose & tail facia is differant on GT/SE/SC. low side trim is diferant on GT/SE, rocker panels are the same on SC as base model.<p>there are also a couple interior items that are only available on GT/SE/SC.<br>
Z||000002||Carrolles||05-04-99||11:29 AM||||All GTs from the 86 1/2 on are fastback body.  Everything else has the notchback.<br>
